    "messages": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "text": "Contact traffic control.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 1,
            "created_at": "2024-09-11 05:35:09.345000"
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "text": "The hearing convenes at 0930. You don't want to be late.",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 4,
            "created_at": "2024-09-12 17:24:48.493000"
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "text": "You read my deposition...it's complete and accurate.",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-09-17 20:46:00.433000"
        },
        {
            "id": 4,
            "text": "Look, I believe you, but there are going to be some heavyweights in there. You got Feds, you got interstellar commerce commission, you got colonial administration, insurance company guys...",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 4,
            "created_at": "2024-09-28 21:16:26.368000"
        },
        {
            "id": 5,
            "text": "This is commercial vessel Nostromo. Registration number 180246. Do you read me. Over.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-09-29 20:06:52.505000"
        },
        {
            "id": 6,
            "text": "Nothing.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-09-29 23:20:42.339000"
        },
        {
            "id": 7,
            "text": "Keep trying.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 1,
            "created_at": "2024-09-30 01:34:00.979000"
        },
        {
            "id": 8,
            "text": "You got a reading yet.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 1,
            "created_at": "2024-10-02 12:38:02.976000"
        },
        {
            "id": 9,
            "text": "I get the picture.",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-10-11 05:22:22.739000"
        },
        {
            "id": 10,
            "text": "We're way out in the boondocks here...",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 2,
            "created_at": "2024-10-15 22:03:04.292000"
        },
        {
            "id": 11,
            "text": "Keep trying...",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 1,
            "created_at": "2024-10-20 04:14:12.056000"
        },
        {
            "id": 12,
            "text": "Just tell them what happened. The important thing is to stay cool and unemotional.",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 4,
            "created_at": "2024-10-26 13:33:25.427000"
        },
        {
            "id": 13,
            "text": "Do you people have earwax, of what? We have been here three hours. How many different ways do you want me to tell the same story?",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-10-26 17:40:02.558000"
        },
        {
            "id": 14,
            "text": "Working on it.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 2,
            "created_at": "2024-10-27 18:58:54.911000"
        },
        {
            "id": 15,
            "text": "Found it.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 2,
            "created_at": "2024-10-27 20:59:18.681000"
        },
        {
            "id": 16,
            "text": "Look at it from our perspective. You freely admit to detonating the engines of, and thereby destroying, an M-Class star-freighter. A rather expensive piece of hardware...",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 5,
            "created_at": "2024-11-04 06:05:35.716000"
        },
        {
            "id": 17,
            "text": "The shuttle's flight recorder corroborates some elements of your account. That the Nostromo set down on LV-426, an unsurveyed planet, at that time. That repairs were made. That it resumed its course and was subsequently set for self-destruct. By you. For reasons unknown.",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 5,
            "created_at": "2024-11-05 17:56:26.554000"
        },
        {
            "id": 18,
            "text": "Hard to believe.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 1,
            "created_at": "2024-11-12 19:16:59.744000"
        },
        {
            "id": 19,
            "text": "What the hell are we doing out here.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 2,
            "created_at": "2024-11-12 21:12:58.666000"
        },
        {
            "id": 20,
            "text": "What are you talking about.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 1,
            "created_at": "2024-11-13 00:14:58.134000"
        },
        {
            "id": 21,
            "text": "Look, I told you...",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-11-16 11:49:28.412000"
        },
        {
            "id": 22,
            "text": "It's not our system.",
            "chat_id": 1,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-11-20 03:42:04.446000"
        },
        {
            "id": 23,
            "text": "It did not, however, contain any entries concerning the hostile life form you allegedly picked up.",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 5,
            "created_at": "2024-12-02 11:25:42.295000"
        },
        {
            "id": 24,
            "text": "Then somebody's gotten to it... doctored the recorder. Who had access to it?",
            "chat_id": 2,
            "account_id": 3,
            "created_at": "2024-12-14 09:47:11.263000"
        }
    ]
}